[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cnpc0witness01"]

; THE WITNESS - the man the detective saved, murdered in the cells every
; loop. Starts in interrogation, is walked to the cells with the escort at
; ~1:30, and waits there for the shot. His heirloom is the source of the loop.

